'''NETSCOUT Systems, Inc.''' (stylized as '''NETSCOUT''') is an American technology company that specializes in software [[Observability (software)|observability]], [[deep packet inspection]], [[DDoS mitigation]] and [[AIOps]]. Headquartered in Westford, Massachusetts, the company was founded in 1984 by Anil Singhal and Narendra Popat, originally under the name '''Frontier Software'''.

